                <pb facs="0422" n="372" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg372"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr. Dun.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-07-26"><hi rendition="#italic">July 26,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Japan acceding, you may act as custodian Chinese legation and afford friendly
                    offices for protection Chinese subjects in Japan either directly or through
                    consuls acting under your instructions, but you will not represent China
                    diplomatically.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
